#, no-wrap
msgid "Partition the circuit and observables into subcircuits and subobservables. Calculate the sampling overhead incurred from cutting these gates and wires. {#partition-the-circuit-and-observables-into-subcircuits-and-subobservables-calculate-the-sampling-overhead-incurred-from-cutting-these-gates-and-wires}"
msgstr "Partiziona il circuito e gli osservabili in sottocircuiti e sottoosservabili. Calcola l'overhead di campionamento derivante dal taglio di questi gate e fili. {#partition-the-circuit-and-observables-into-subcircuits-and-subobservables-calculate-the-sampling-overhead-incurred-from-cutting-these-gates-and-wires}"

